<h3>Who created Polytrack?</h3>
<p>Polytrack was created by Kodub.</p>

<h3>Can I play Polytrack on mobile devices and desktop?</h3>
<p>Polytrack runs in your browser on desktop. Mobile support depends on the embedded version and how well its controls translate to touch devices, so performance and usability can vary between phones, tablets, and computers.</p>

